Key Tips: 

Use Tables: Convert your data range to an official Excel Table (Ctrl+T) first. This allows the pivot table to automatically update when you add new rows. 

Refresh Data: If you change source data, click the Refresh button on the "PivotTable Analyze" tab to update the table. 

Shortcut: Use Alt -> N -> V -> T to quickly open the pivot table dialog box.  
